  "body": "`cargo test -p xtask` fails on upstream/main `7e26134bf` (M5 main-health, 2026-11-17 00:35Z; last green `fac6c8e8d`).\n\n1. `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` (xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs:107): `adaptive_fig8_crossing: app::verify`. The header at `crates/app/tests/adaptive_fig8_crossing.rs:5` names `app::verify`; verify moved to `sim`, so it should say `sim::verify`. From merge `d8c710f5f` (PR #2273).\n2. The same test also reports `suites without a Gate map: [\"shipped_from_disk\"]`: `crates/app/tests/shipped_from_disk.rs` has no Gate map line (it covers `app::posting`, `app::posting_files`). From PR #2293 (`30a81b012`).\n\nEach PR passed alone; this law runs only in `cargo test -p xtask`, which the post-merge batch on the app suites does not run.\n\nChecked locally: with both header lines fixed, `cargo test -p xtask` passes (147 tests).\n\nDone means: `cargo test -p xtask` is green on main.\n",
